The '''Silent Pearl''' is an {{Uncommon}} item. It is a special [[Ender Pearl]] that is sold by the [[Pearl Dealer]] in [[The End]]. Just like a normal [[Ender Pearl]], a '''Silent Pearl''' can be thrown and will teleport the player to the place where they land. However, players can use '''Silent Pearls''' to teleport without attracting [[Endermen]], as they won't notice them. It is useful to get to the bottom of the [[The End]].

