=== Shop Purchase ===
'''Silent Pearls''' are sold in the {{NPCSprite|Pearl Dealer}}'s shop. Players can purchase 8 for {{c|1,200}}.

=== End Race ===
When players complete the [[End Race]] in 3 minutes for the first time, they will receive 8 '''Silent Pearls''' for free.

== Usage ==
'''Silent Pearls''' can be thrown like regular {{Item|Ender Pearl}}s, but they don't spawn {{MobSprite|Enderman;Endermen}} nor deal damage upon landing.

== Trivia ==
*Like normal [[Ender Pearl]]s, '''Silent Pearls''' cannot be used during the [[End Race]].

